@startuml NekoCafe_Sub_UseCase_Customer
left to right direction

actor "顾客" as Customer
actor "VIP会员" as VIPCustomer
Customer <|-- VIPCustomer

rectangle "预约与点单模块" {
  usecase "用户登录" as Login
  usecase "提交桌位预约" as Reserve
  usecase "提交菜品订单" as Order
  usecase "AI 智能推荐桌位/菜品" as AIRecommend
  usecase "享受专享折扣" as VIPDiscount
}

Customer --> Reserve
Customer --> Order
VIPCustomer --> VIPDiscount

Reserve .> Login : <<include>>
Order .> Login : <<include>>

Reserve <. AIRecommend : <<extend>> (条件: 开启个性化推荐)
Order <. AIRecommend : <<extend>> (条件: 开启个性化推荐)
VIPDiscount .> Order : <<extend>>
@enduml